# Production build config for the console.
#
# VITE_API_BASE is intentionally UNSET: the console calls the kernel SAME-ORIGIN via the Cloudflare
# Pages Function proxy (console/functions/v1/[[path]].js -> Cloud Run). The client uses relative /v1
# URLs, the Function forwards them to the API, and there is no CORS to maintain.
#
# (If you ever serve the console and API on truly separate origins, set
#  VITE_API_BASE=https://<kernel-host> here and add that origin to the kernel's CORS_ORIGINS.)
